  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 13
  storyText: "Something happened today. Not big. Not like the first day. But something.
    Around noon, we heard a loud crash from below. Glass breaking. Then a car alarm
    started screaming. It went on for minutes. Maybe hours. Time is blurry now. We
    looked out the window \u2014 a car had slammed into the canteen wall. The driver
    was gone. Or maybe never there. Zombies gathered around the sound, bumping into
    each other like confused shoppers. One of them tripped over a duck. The duck
    quacked. Loud. We held our breath. The zombies turned. The duck ran. The zombies
    followed. For a few seconds, we forgot we were scared. Then the alarm stopped.
    Silence came back. The duck made it, by the way. We saw it waddling away like
    nothing happened. Legend.\r"
